    <title>Physical Exam</title>
    <text><paragraph>Vital signs recorded on 2026-01-14; see the referring visit&apos;s Vital Signs section. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Thin, tired and courteous; temperature 38.2 °C, pulse 100</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Dull with reduced breath sounds at the right base</td></tr><tr><td>Abdomen</td><td>Tender liver edge 3 cm below the right costal margin; right lower intercostal tenderness; no jaundice; no peritonism</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

